  "conclusion_zh": "本文将柔性磁触觉仿真定位为发现并验证模型改进方向的研究数据环境，而不是要求所有候选模型及所有动作都同步改善。由源侧记录拟合的对称分轴动态代理支持连续交互、丰富运动生成与因果算法闭环；既有同路径实测与虚拟实验复现了慢历史补偿和因果平面学习的主要改进方向。充分训练的1000条虚拟扩集模型在独立虚拟几何上显著改善平面重建，并在未用于训练或检查点选择的Yellow既有真实记录上，将共同有效帧XY误差由0.740 mm降至0.630 mm，降低14.8%。在另两批分别采集的同协议新轨迹在线比较中，第一条复杂路径去固定平移后的XY误差由0.267 mm降至0.189 mm，降低29.4%，相邻残差跳变率由3.91%降至1.90%，降低51.4%；第二条的跳变率也降低33.0%，但形状误差上升。另一普通128条扩集候选在三批36条复杂真实记录中均减少跳变，三批平均降低14.5%、14.1%和6.2%，并降低停驻波动。上述结果分别支持目标器件迁移、动作相关的形状与连续性共同改善，以及时间稳定性改善三类有效方向。原始坐标偏移和部分精度代价同时保留，去平移指标不冒充在线原点校准，也不把模型内的未验证假设写成实物定律。仿真因此能够帮助扩展运动经验、定位薄弱条件、提出训练干预并筛出值得继续的候选；其贡献是可复算的方向发现与条件性收益，不是已实现完整物理数字孪生或普遍最优重建。",
  "conclusion_en": "We position flexible magnetic-tactile simulation as a research data environment for discovering and evaluating useful model-improvement directions, not as a requirement that every candidate improves every motion. The source-fitted, symmetrically axis-separated dynamic surrogate supports continuous interaction, diverse motion generation and causal reconstruction loops. The sufficiently trained 1,000-trajectory augmentation candidate reduces paired XY error on previously recorded, held-out Yellow trials from 0.740 to 0.630 mm (14.8%). In two separately acquired online batches following the same new-motion protocol, the first complex path improves translation-removed XY error from 0.267 to 0.189 mm (29.4%) and reduces adjacent residual-jump rate from 3.91% to 1.90% (51.4%). The second path also reduces jumps by 33.0%, while its translation-removed error increases. A distinct ordinary 128-trajectory candidate reduces jumps on all 36 complex real trial records across three batches, with batch-average reductions of 14.5%, 14.1% and 6.2%, and lower dwell fluctuation. These are separate, model-specific contributions: target-device transfer on existing recordings, motion-dependent joint improvement in trajectory shape and continuity, and improved temporal stability. Absolute-coordinate bias and accuracy costs remain reported; retrospective translation removal is not an online origin calibration. Simulation therefore provides reproducible direction discovery and conditional gains rather than universal optimality or a validated full-physics digital twin.",
